<title>UK: Lehman prices multi-tranche asset-backed FRN.</title>
<headline>Lehman prices multi-tranche asset-backed FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Household Consumer Loan Trust 1997-1 has priced its multi-tranche asset-backed FRN which totals $919.2 million, lead manager Lehman Brothers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Tranche A1 is for $729.6 million, tranche A2 is for $48 million, tranche A3 is for $62.4 million.</p>
<p>There are also class B notes of $45.6 million and $33.6 million of certificates which are being privately placed.</p>
<p>TRANCHE A1</p>
<p> AMT    $729.6 MLN    BASE	*1M-LIBOR  LEGAL MAT   15.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+12.5 BP  EXP MAT     16.JUL.03</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 FULL FEES  18 BP     AVE LIFE    2.4 YEARS</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 ISS/REOFF  PAR</p>
<p> NOTES     *CAPPED AT 12.5 PCT</p>
<p>+ + + + +</p>
<p>TRANCHE A2</p>
<p> AMT    $48 MLN	 BASE     **1M-LIBOR  LEGAL MAT   15.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **25 BP     EXP MAT     16.JUL.03</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 FULL FEES  30 BP     AVE LIFE    4.9 YEARS</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA	  ISS/REOFF  PAR</p>
<p> NOTES    **CAPPED AT 14 PCT</p>
<p>+ + + + +</p>
<p>TRANCHE A3</p>
<p> AMT    $62.4 MLN     BASE    ***1M-LIBOR  LEGAL MAT   15.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN  ***35 BP     EXP MAT     16.JUL.03</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  FULL FEES  35 BP     AVE LIFE    4.9 YEARS</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   ISS/REOFF  PAR</p>
<p> NOTES   ***CAPPED AT 14.0 PCT</p>
<p>+ + + + +</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 PAY DATE  L-12.MAR.97</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
